From 74f14b426ff2ddea4d3267cf65f2d5373c6424da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robin Lintermann <rl@karo-electronics.de>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 09:16:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: improve error messages and code style

- Add specific property names in FCONF error messages (fconf_dyn_cfg_getter.c)
- Show exact size exceeded in bl_common.c image load error (already committed)
- Change ERROR to INFO for missing nvmem nodes (stm32mp_dt.c, already committed)
- Improve stm32_get_otp_value error handling (stm32mp_common.c)
- Simplify return logic and clean up style in nvmem.c
- Remove redundant null checks and improve code style in stm32mp2_private.c

Generated by Mistral Vibe.
Co-Authored-By: Mistral Vibe <vibe@mistral.ai>
